        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\r\n\r\nI can not reproduce this, as I don't have the zsh extension showing the history like that.\r\n\r\nHowever, my guess would be that that history uses `vim.g.terminal_color_8` which in 'mini.hues' is the same as background (hence virtually invisible when actually shown). Would you mind try adding the following line **after** the `require('mini.hues').setup()` call:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nvim.g.terminal_color_8 = '#767676'\r\n```\r\n\r\nDoes this fix the issue?",
