        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Yes! It works well !!!\r\n```\r\n{\r\n   \"echasnovski/mini.hues\",\r\n   version = false,\r\n   config = function()\r\n     require(\"mini.hues\").setup({\r\n       background = \"#0E1F25\",\r\n       foreground = \"#c0c8cc\",\r\n       n_hues = 8,\r\n       satuation = \"medium\",\r\n       accent = \"fg\",\r\n       plugin = { default = true },\r\n     })\r\n     vim.g.terminal_color_8 = '#767676'\r\n   end,\r\n },\r\n```\r\nThanks for your quick reply very much! Taking this small problem into consideration for your plugin will be good!",
