        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yeah, I think having 0-7 and 8-15 terminal colors the same is the best approach here. Otherwise, there is no good way to choose which shade of background/foreground to use to have a universally good user experience. I'll leave it to the user to tweak it to their liking.\r\n\r\nThanks again for raising the issue, though!",
